    "MISSING CONCURRENT PAPER — arXiv:2505.11274 (SelfBudgeter, May 2026): 'SelfBudgeter: Adaptive Token Allocation for Efficient LLM Reasoning' trains reasoning models to self-estimate required reasoning budget via budget-guided GRPO, achieving 61% compression on math tasks. This paper is directly concurrent (published May 2026) and addresses the same per-request budget allocation problem. It must be cited and differentiated: unlike SelfBudgeter, which requires fine-tuning the deployed reasoning model (not black-box compatible), the proposed classifier operates on prompt surface features only and can be deployed as middleware in front of any model API without model access.",
